<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE-DUTCH SARA LEE UNIT 96/97 NET UP 14PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-DUTCH SARA LEE UNIT 96/97 NET UP 14PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in billions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Net profit			0.935  vs  0.820</p>
<p>    Turnover			 10.14   vs  9.50</p>
<p>    Operating Income		1.26   vs  1.12</p>
<p>Note -- Sara Lee is a fully-owned unit of Sara Lee Corp of the U.S., overseeing most of the conglomerates consumer products operations outside the U.S. The company said it expected to see further growth in operating income during the 1997/98 financial year, barring unexpected developments in coffee and foreign currency markets.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
